{"id":"edc4ffdba40ef7c6","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-heyting.md","title":"Heyting Algebra","display":"df-heyting — Heyting Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-heyting","aliases":["93-df-heyting"],"display":"df-heyting — Heyting Algebra","depends_on":["[[93-df-lattice]]","[[93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]","[[93-df-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-heyting"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-heyting</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-heyting — Heyting Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b5f38bd115ed203\" href=\"?note=3b5f38bd115ed203\" title=\"93-df-lattice\">93-df-lattice</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0454a0272a142daa\" href=\"?note=0454a0272a142daa\" title=\"93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice\">93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf H\">\\(\\mathbf H\\)</span> is an algebra candidate with prospective basic symbols <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge,\\vee,\\to,0,1\">\\(\\wedge,\\vee,\\to,0,1\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedLat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedLat}_{93}\\)</span> are the predicates and nullary-value constructor of the cited definitions.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathsf H},\\alpha_{\\mathsf H},\\tau_{\\mathsf H},\\mathbf H^-,\\mathbf H^{01}\">\\(S_{\\mathsf H},\\alpha_{\\mathsf H},\\tau_{\\mathsf H},\\mathbf H^-,\\mathbf H^{01}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HeytAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{HeytAlg}_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}heyting}\\vdash\nS_{\\mathsf H}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\wedge,\\vee,\\to,0,1\\},\\\\\n\\alpha_{\\mathsf H}(\\wedge)=\\alpha_{\\mathsf H}(\\vee)\n=\\alpha_{\\mathsf H}(\\to)&amp;\\coloneqq2,\\qquad\n\\alpha_{\\mathsf H}(0)=\\alpha_{\\mathsf H}(1)\\coloneqq0,\\\\\n\\tau_{\\mathsf H}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle S_{\\mathsf H},\\alpha_{\\mathsf H}\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}heyting}\\vdash\nS_{\\mathsf H}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\wedge,\\vee,\\to,0,1\\},\\\\\n\\alpha_{\\mathsf H}(\\wedge)=\\alpha_{\\mathsf H}(\\vee)\n=\\alpha_{\\mathsf H}(\\to)&amp;\\coloneqq2,\\qquad\n\\alpha_{\\mathsf H}(0)=\\alpha_{\\mathsf H}(1)\\coloneqq0,\\\\\n\\tau_{\\mathsf H}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle S_{\\mathsf H},\\alpha_{\\mathsf H}\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}heyting}\\vdash\n\\mathbf H^-\\coloneqq\n\\langle|\\mathbf H|,\\wedge^{\\mathbf H},\\vee^{\\mathbf H}\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathbf H^{01}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle|\\mathbf H|,\\wedge^{\\mathbf H},\\vee^{\\mathbf H},\n\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(0;\\mathbf H),\n\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(1;\\mathbf H)\\right\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}heyting}\\vdash\n\\mathbf H^-\\coloneqq\n\\langle|\\mathbf H|,\\wedge^{\\mathbf H},\\vee^{\\mathbf H}\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathbf H^{01}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle|\\mathbf H|,\\wedge^{\\mathbf H},\\vee^{\\mathbf H},\n\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(0;\\mathbf H),\n\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(1;\\mathbf H)\\right\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}heyting}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HeytAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf H)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_{\\mathsf H}}(\\mathbf H)\n\\land\\mathrm{BoundedLat}_{93}(\\mathbf H^{01})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in|\\mathbf H|\\;\\Bigl(\na\\wedge^{\\mathbf H}b\\leq_{\\mathbf H^-}c\n\\leftrightarrow a\\leq_{\\mathbf H^-}(b\\to^{\\mathbf H}c)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}heyting}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HeytAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf H)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_{\\mathsf H}}(\\mathbf H)\n\\land\\mathrm{BoundedLat}_{93}(\\mathbf H^{01})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in|\\mathbf H|\\;\\Bigl(\na\\wedge^{\\mathbf H}b\\leq_{\\mathbf H^-}c\n\\leftrightarrow a\\leq_{\\mathbf H^-}(b\\to^{\\mathbf H}c)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}heyting}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S_{\\mathsf H},\\alpha_{\\mathsf H})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}heyting}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S_{\\mathsf H},\\alpha_{\\mathsf H})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The complete Heyting signature is explicit, so general algebraic morphisms apply. The bounded-lattice reduct extracts the two nullary values from their operation graphs before using them as bounds.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"3b5f38bd115ed203","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"0454a0272a142daa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-similarity-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf H","display":false},{"tex":"\\wedge,\\vee,\\to,0,1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedLat}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"S_{\\mathsf H},\\alpha_{\\mathsf H},\\tau_{\\mathsf H},\\mathbf H^-,\\mathbf H^{01}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HeytAlg}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}heyting}\\vdash\nS_{\\mathsf H}&\\coloneqq\\{\\wedge,\\vee,\\to,0,1\\},\\\\\n\\alpha_{\\mathsf H}(\\wedge)=\\alpha_{\\mathsf H}(\\vee)\n=\\alpha_{\\mathsf H}(\\to)&\\coloneqq2,\\qquad\n\\alpha_{\\mathsf H}(0)=\\alpha_{\\mathsf H}(1)\\coloneqq0,\\\\\n\\tau_{\\mathsf H}&\\coloneqq\\langle S_{\\mathsf H},\\alpha_{\\mathsf H}\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}heyting}\\vdash\n\\mathbf H^-\\coloneqq\n\\langle|\\mathbf H|,\\wedge^{\\mathbf H},\\vee^{\\mathbf H}\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathbf H^{01}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle|\\mathbf H|,\\wedge^{\\mathbf H},\\vee^{\\mathbf H},\n\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(0;\\mathbf H),\n\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(1;\\mathbf H)\\right\\rangle","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}heyting}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HeytAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf H)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_{\\mathsf H}}(\\mathbf H)\n\\land\\mathrm{BoundedLat}_{93}(\\mathbf H^{01})\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in|\\mathbf H|\\;\\Bigl(\na\\wedge^{\\mathbf H}b\\leq_{\\mathbf H^-}c\n\\leftrightarrow a\\leq_{\\mathbf H^-}(b\\to^{\\mathbf H}c)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}heyting}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S_{\\mathsf H},\\alpha_{\\mathsf H})","display":true}],"bytes":2090,"backlinks":[{"id":"45e1649786ce1775","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HeytAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf H)$ (Heyting algebra, see [[93-df-heyting]])"},{"id":"38bccd77c29488bb","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HeytAlg}_{93}$ is the Heyting-algebra predicate of [[93-df-heyting]]."},{"id":"611144cc6c6066b7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B)$ and $\\mathrm{HeytAlg}_{93}$ is from [[93-df-heyting]]."},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-66","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-heyting]]"}],"outgoing":["3b5f38bd115ed203","0454a0272a142daa","ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","6730349967b8ffce"]}